  "text": "Haan—₹700 ke andar acne-prone skin ke liye **salicylic acid** wala serum meri first choice hoga, especially agar pimples/blackheads/oily skin hai.\n\n### 🥇 Meri top pick\n### [Minimalist Salicylic Acid Face Serum]()\n*₹495*\n\n**Minimalist 2% Salicylic Acid Serum** — around ₹495–₹550. Current listings mein 30 ml roughly ₹494–₹549 mil raha hai. [www.nykaa.com](https://www.nykaa.com/serums-for-acne-removal/c/72546?utm_source=chatgpt.com)  \n- Active pimples + blackheads/whiteheads ke liye\n- 2% salicylic acid pores ko unclog karne mein help karta hai\n- **Raat ko 2–3 baar/week se start** karo; tolerate ho toh frequency badha sakte ho.\n- Saath mein **moisturizer + SPF 30–50 sunscreen** zaroor.\n\n### Agar acne ke saath acne marks bhi hain\n### [The Derma Co Sali-Cinamide Anti-Acne Face Serum]()\n*₹313*\n\nIsme **2% salicylic acid + 5% niacinamide** hai aur brand par current price ₹449 listed hai. [thedermaco.com](https://thedermaco.com/products/sali-cinamide-anti-acne-serum-with-2-salicylic-acid-5-niacinamide-30ml?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Simple choice:**  \n- 🔴 **Active pimples/blackheads → Minimalist 2% Salicylic Acid**\n- 🟤 **Pimples + marks + oily skin → The Derma Co Sali-Cinamide**\n\nAgar tum mujhe **apni skin type (oily/dry/combination) aur acne ki photo** bhej do, main ₹700 ke andar **serum + moisturizer + sunscreen ka complete routine** bhi suggest kar sakta hoon.",
